## 9. Recommended next step

Freeze Phase 0 scope now. Build the Egress Gateway, app-data layout, and **a resource-governor prototype that proves LLM + avatar + voice can coexist on an 8GB integrated machine**. That prototype de-risks the single biggest unknown in the plan before any feature work.
